# What a CLI deploy must never upload.
#
# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory. Unlike a git-connected build,
# nothing here has been filtered by .gitignore first — so local secrets sitting
# beside the source would travel into the deployment.
#
# Belt and braces: these are gitignored too, but a CLI deploy is precisely the
# path where that stops protecting anything.
.env
.env.*
.vercel
node_modules
.next
.git
